1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,550
(Girl:)I'll take your word for it.

2
00:00:02,549 --> 00:00:03,549
(Howard:)You should.

3
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,920
(Howard:)He's really looked.

4
00:00:06,887 --> 00:00:09,387
(Raj:)I'm Raj, by the way.

5
00:00:09,389 --> 00:00:10,989
(Raj:)This is Howard.
Hi.

6
00:00:10,991 --> 00:00:12,421
(Girl:)Claire.

7
00:00:12,425 --> 00:00:14,355
Well, I've seen you here before,
Claire.

8
00:00:14,361 --> 00:00:15,861
(Claire:)It's my first time.

9
00:00:15,862 --> 00:00:18,492
(Claire:)I'm looking for inspiration
for this movie I'm writing.

10
00:00:18,498 --> 00:00:19,768
(Howard:)You're a screenwriter?

11
00:00:19,766 --> 00:00:23,006
(Claire:)Well, screenwriter,
slash bartender,

12
00:00:23,003 --> 00:00:26,703
(Claire:)slash, a month away
from living in my car.

13
00:00:26,706 --> 00:00:29,236
(Raj:)Yeah, I get that.

14
00:00:29,242 --> 00:00:30,672
(Raj:)I'm a scientist,

15
00:00:30,677 --> 00:00:32,077
(Raj:)slash party planner,

16
00:00:32,078 --> 00:00:34,078
(Raj:)slash small-dog enthusiast,

17
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,880
(Claire:)slash...

18
00:00:35,882 --> 00:00:39,052
(Raj:)guy who probably should have
stopped at “scientist.”

19
00:00:39,052 --> 00:00:40,952
(Claire:)You're really a scientist?

20
00:00:40,954 --> 00:00:42,054
(Raj:)Well, astrophysicist.

21
00:00:42,055 --> 00:00:43,425
(Claire:)That's perfect.

22
00:00:43,423 --> 00:00:46,093
(Claire:)Do you think I could pick your
brain for my movie some time?

23
00:00:46,092 --> 00:00:47,862
(Claire:)It's animated sci-fi for kids.

24
00:00:47,861 --> 00:00:49,861
(Raj:)Sure. I love animated movies.
He does,

25
00:00:49,863 --> 00:00:52,663
and he has the Lilo & Stitch
collector plates to prove it.

26
00:00:54,467 --> 00:00:57,337
(Raj:)Excuse me for wanting
a little magic in my life.

27
00:00:58,672 --> 00:00:59,972
(Claire:)Here's my number.

